@prefix swos: <https://swos.example.org/ontology/discipline/> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
<https://swos.example.org/discipline/art_criticism> a swos:Discipline ; skos:prefLabel "art criticism" .
<https://swos.example.org/discipline/art_criticism> swos:usesMethod <https://swos.example.org/method/critical-description> .
<https://swos.example.org/discipline/art_criticism> swos:requiresCriterion <https://swos.example.org/criterion/art-criticism/description> .
