<https://swos.example.org/discipline/art_criticism> swos:requiresCriterion <https://swos.example.org/criterion/art-criticism/frame> .
<https://swos.example.org/discipline/art_criticism> swos:requiresCriterion <https://swos.example.org/criterion/art-criticism/reception> .
<https://swos.example.org/discipline/art_criticism> swos:requiresCriterion <https://swos.example.org/criterion/art-criticism/positionality> .
<https://swos.example.org/criterion/art-criticism/description> a swos:Criterion ; skos:prefLabel "sensory description" .
<https://swos.example.org/criterion/art-criticism/judgement> a swos:Criterion ; skos:prefLabel "judgement anchored to features" .
<https://swos.example.org/criterion/art-criticism/frame> a swos:Criterion ; skos:prefLabel "cultural framing" .
<https://swos.example.org/criterion/art-criticism/reception> a swos:Criterion ; skos:prefLabel "reception and counter-reading" .
<https://swos.example.org/criterion/art-criticism/positionality> a swos:Criterion ; skos:prefLabel "critical positionality" .
